  "sourceQuote": "직각삼각형 $\\text{AED}$에서 $\\overline{\\text{AD}}=\\overline{\\text{AB}}=15$, $\\overline{\\text{ED}}=9$이므로 $$\\overline{\\text{AE}} = \\sqrt{15^2 - 9^2} = \\sqrt{225 - 81} = 12$$ $\\overline{\\text{AD}}\\parallel\\overline{\\text{BC}}$이고 $\\overline{\\text{EG}}\\perp\\overline{\\text{BC}}$이므로 $\\overline{\\text{EF}}\\perp\\overline{\\text{AD}}$이다. 직각삼각형의 닮음에 의해 $\\overline{\\text{AE}}^2 = \\overline{\\text{AF}}\\cdot\\overline{\\text{AD}}$이므로 $$12^2 = \\overline{\\text{AF}} \\times 15 \\implies \\overline{\\text{AF}} = \\frac{144}{15} = \\frac{48}{5}$$ 따라서 정답은 ④이다.",
  "sourceConditions": [
